flowchart TD
    A([State intent — one scoped feature]) --> B[RED — failing test on real data]
    B -->|must FAIL| C[GREEN — minimal code]
    C -->|must PASS| D{Verify independently}
    D -->|something off| B
    D -->|real? honest? minimal diff?| E[Commit — RED then GREEN]
    E --> F[CI green — fmt · clippy · test · coverage · fuzz · deny]
    F --> A
